","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:153359","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c77625","characterName":"速水 綾希","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"68138","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"267513"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20681"],"vndbCharacterId":"c77625"},"originalCharacterName":"速水 綾希","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"422"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Aki is Kouta's childhood friend and has always been his neighbour. Her parents and Kouta's parents have been friends since long before they were born, so their two families have always been very close. Aki is a very sweet and cute girl, her popularity with boys is incredible, just like with girls. She doesn't seem very receptive to Kouta but in reality she has realized longer than him that they were of the opposite sex."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"What if he slips into my bed in the middle of the night!?\" and that's why she starts to panic when she learns that Kouta and her family will come to live with them for two weeks, to her mother's great joy..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c77625"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"風見琥太（主人公）の幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"リップなど、軽めの化粧をしている今どきの女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ノリが軽く、男女別け隔てなく話し、クラスメイトとも仲が良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰とでも仲良くなれるため、恋愛経験も豊富そうだが、誰かと付き合ったことは一度もない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"色恋沙汰に興味津々な周囲の反応から、琥太の事が気になりだしたが、それは幼馴染だから特別に感じていると思っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな中、なし崩し的に一緒に暮らす事になった事をキッカケに、再び琥太のことを意識するようになっていく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20681","sourceWorkId":"27426","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"風見琥太（主人公）の幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"リップなど、軽めの化粧をしている今どきの女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ノリが軽く、男女別け隔てなく話し、クラスメイトとも仲が良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰とでも仲良くなれるため、恋愛経験も豊富そうだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰かと付き合ったことは一度もない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"色恋沙汰に興味津々な周囲の反応から、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"琥太の事が気になりだしたが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それは幼馴染だから特別に感じていると思っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな中、なし崩し的に一緒に暮らす事になった事をキッカケに、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"再び琥太のことを意識するようになっていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ね。期間限定のお試しで、あたしと恋人になってくれない？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"68138"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20681","sourceWorkId":"27426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"161 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20681","sourceWorkId":"27426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20681","sourceWorkId":"27426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20681","sourceWorkId":"27426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70a666d1bd8869279d23bfd54695d29fd5d0fe86c009566014009fae1ab4c9f9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/10e514de0c17e1138067b7b7f638a27631cdb5ede9d888501c6f7565a7076004.webp","width":81,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"長妻樹里","creatorId":"vndb:s1197","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1197","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1197","name":"長妻 樹里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:267513:68138:8493:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c82620","characterName":"風間 琥太","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c82620"},"originalCharacterName":"風間 琥太","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kouta is Aki's childhood friend for whom he has always had particularly strong feelings, without really understanding what they were. Passionate about photography, he spends his free time photographing all the landscapes he finds pretty, a passion he was passed on to him by his parents. One day, as he was uploading his pictures to his club room computer, his mother Yuri contacted him to tell him that there had been a bathtub accident at home and that it was going to be renovated."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Starting from tomorrow, you'll be staying at Aki's place\" she said. This is difficult for a teenager who doesn't understand how he feels about the person he cares about the most. Thus began his adventure with his best pal Aki..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c82620"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/981bf4a0e62dbf809f068efc0001e3b9b38cecfd9899459b417a8a7edfc8ec3d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4d7a7638313940d802e2317f82a84f80e7ed6eb5de84e3ccaa5a7b9bda1a5326.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p4542","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:4340","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p4542","name":"あざらしそふと","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:27426:4340","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p4542","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p4542","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p45